WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.633
There are folks that run
away from the sound of battle.

00:00:03.633 --> 00:00:05.567
And then there
are folks that run

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:06.600
towards the noise of the guns.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.667
We are those guys that
move towards danger.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.367
That's our job.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:16.166
[gunfire]

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:17.600
We're moving this way.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.433
[gunfire]

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:26.400
I've served with a lot
of great men, great women,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:33.033
but that particular group
have become my family.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.100
You know what else
I've been thinking about?

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.166
It's what we should do when
we get out of here, man.

00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:38.967
Yeah?

00:00:38.967 --> 00:00:40.033
Yeah.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.867
I always wanted to
open up a guitar shop.

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:44.934
We'll just hang out,
play some awesome tunes.

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:47.633
We'll even get my dad
involved, you know?

00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:49.233
Make it a whole little
family business.

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:49.934
Yeah.

00:00:52.266 --> 00:00:55.767
I never had a brother
before you, so--

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:57.433
BENJAMIN MAYHURST: Multiple
times, I know guys put

00:00:57.433 --> 00:01:00.266
their lives on the line for me.

00:01:00.266 --> 00:01:01.433
And I know there
were times when I

00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:03.633
did the same for other people.

00:01:03.633 --> 00:01:05.734
And that doesn't go away.

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:08.100
For right now, on this
roof, my responsibility

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.133
is to the safety of
all of these men.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.433
OK?

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:12.233
Everyone.

00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:13.400
And I need you here with me.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.200
You understand?

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.367
I need you.

